<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46438" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῶμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώννυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>loin-cloth, drawers</i>, worn
			next the body in a boxing contest, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. δέ οἱ πρῶτον παρακάββαλεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.683
				</span></i>
			; in war, <i><span class="en">
				4.216
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπόμην σάκος οἶον ἔχων καὶ ζ.
					φαεινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.482
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώματα καὶ κυπάσσιδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					15.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδυμα, πεζοφόροις ζ</span>
			. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				246
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>band</i> used in surgery, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώνη</span>
			, <i>woman's girdle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλυσε ζ. παρθένω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					8.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				452
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1514.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				320.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				432
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.272
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pers.
			</span></i>).—A non-
				Att.
			 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῶσμα</span></b>  (v.
				Thom.Mag.<i><span class="en">
				p.165
			</span></i> R.) in <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.2.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fasc.</u>
				45
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				3.1
			</span></i>.</div>
